  "summary": "Plan-only ACCEPT. The new ID-I05, ID-S04, ID-L03 and ID-T04 specify the missing trusted Infrastructure construction and test seam for the already accepted October JDT-LS adapter. The factory consumes an issued JdtNavigation lease and trusted profile/runtime injection, returns a context only on Opened, defines cancellation and disposal, keeps raw replies subject to containment and authority checks, and keeps real runtime composition fail closed until T022/T023. It adds no Worker operation, model-selected root/executable, 18.1 public-contract change or 18.3 shared-lease ownership change. This is within the accepted 18.2 architecture, not a human-reserved architecture change outside it; root retains approval/hash-binding authority. Prior P-PATH-TRUST-01 and T-PATH-LAUNCH-ORDER-01 remain resolved. Deterministic plan validation returned no errors. Current tasks were not reviewed. diff_sha256 is SHA-256 of canonical sorted path-to-artifact-SHA256 JSON encoded as UTF-8 with a terminal newline."
